{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-provider-badge",
  "description": "DSH Web 增强插件：在会话输入框下方模型及推理等级选择器正前方渲染 provider 徽标（ROUTE_LABELS 缩写表/显示名推导，黑体对比字色、ROUTE_COLORS 色表/调色板底，随会话选择即时跟随；点徽标选色并持久化到 localStorage）。不写 settings、不介入模型请求。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "provider-badge",
    "web-ui"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
